{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-tinc-festive-santa-bottle-sold-via-waitrose-2601-0057","content_id":"223be349-db77-4691-9239-d6901d2837d1","description":"Product Recall for Tinc Festive Santa Bottle presenting a serious choking risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"b9d06876-8126-4413-babf-129003754b49","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-08T16:47:18+00:00","id":"b9d06876-8126-4413-babf-129003754b49","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-08T16:47:18+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695fdf96027e0aa1765a5b04/2601-0057-product-recall-tinc-festive-santa-bottle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Tinc Festive Santa Bottle sold by Waitrose</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as the straw can disintegrate, creating small parts.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The product has been recalled from end users by Waitrose.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/cooking accessories – Mugs/Cups (Non-Disposable)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Tinc</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>Festive Santa</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5055610335627 </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifier</td>\n      <td>XMSTBOTT</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Plastic Santa-themed bottle.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_b9d06876-8126-4413-babf-129003754b49\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/695fdf96027e0aa1765a5b04/2601-0057-product-recall-tinc-festive-santa-bottle.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as the straw can disintegrate, creating small parts. These small parts pose a choking risk to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users sold by Waitrose </p>\n\n<p>We recommend that you stop using the product immediately and ensure it is out of reach of children. Return it to your nearest Waitrose &amp; Partners for a full refund. For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.waitrose.com/ecom/help-information/product-recalls?srsltid=AfmBOoon3Xkh6ocOIA6_Sg7zwtH5eHH7TlHRdp21hNQPP0WJeCsxBZGb\">Recall of Santa Bottle</a>.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2601-0057</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-08T16:53:51Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-08","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_r